slider19:4<0,10,1{1/2,1/4,1/4D,1/4T,1/8,1/8D,1/8T,1/16,1/16D,1/16T,1/32}>-II rate
slider20:7<2,16,1>-II length (steps)
slider21:2<1,4,1>-II octaves
slider22:0<-2,2,1>-II octave offset
slider23:60<10,100,1>-II gate (%)
slider24:0<0,75,1>-II swing (%)
slider25:100<0,100,1>-II probability (%)
slider26:0<0,2,1{Square,Triangle,Organ}>-II wave
slider27:3500<80,16000,1>-II cutoff (Hz)
slider28:15<0,100,1>-II resonance (%)
slider29:600<20,5000,1>-II decay (ms, 5000 = hold)
slider30:55<0,100,1>-II level (%)
slider31:35<-100,100,1>-II pan
slider32:45<0,100,1>-II send (%)
