slider55:6<0,9,1{1/16,1/8T,1/8,1/8D,1/4T,1/4,1/4D,1/2,1/2D,1 bar}>-MD-6 sync time
slider56:45<0,100,0.1>-MD-6 feedback (%)
slider57:40<0,100,0.1>-MD-6 level (%)
slider58:2.6<0.4,5,0.01>-Plate decay (s)
slider59:30<0,100,1>-Plate mix (%)
slider60:35<0,100,1>-Fate (%)
slider61:0<-24,6,0.1>-Volume (dB)
slider62:0<0,16,1>-MIDI channel (0 = omni)
slider63:0<0,100,1>-Band sat (%)
slider64:30<0,100,1>-Bias (%)
slider65:120<40,400,1>-Sat low band (Hz)
slider66:6000<2000,16000,10>-Sat high band (Hz)
slider67:-0.3<-24,0,0.1>-Ceiling (dB)
slider68:1<0,1,1{Off,Clip}>-(unused, was output stage)
slider69:0.7<0.02,20,0.01>-I LFO rate (Hz)
slider70:2<0,9,1{4 bars,2 bars,1 bar,3/4,1/2,1/4,1/4T,1/8,1/8T,1/16}>-I LFO sync rate
