slider98:60<0,100,0.1>-MD-6 time (free: 20 ms - 2 s)
slider99:35<0,100,0.1>-MD-6 mod rate
slider100:15<0,100,0.1>-MD-6 mod depth
slider101:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Plate on
